                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.248/235: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lauchlin Currie,
                        Administrative Assistant to President Roosevelt, to
                        Madame Chiang Kai-shek
                    </hi><anchor n="94" xml:id="d757-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-09-05">September 5, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>British have agreed to diversion of 33 Hudsons and 33 DB–7s by end of year.</p>
            </div>
